      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The seeds ringing BRELOOM’s tail are\nmade of hardened toxic spores. It is\nhorrible to eat the seeds.\fJust taking a bite of this POKéMON’s\nseed will cause your stomach to rumble.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
